{"video":"S6xR7_zvbjg","lines":[{"t":[0,3.8],"en":"I'm telling you something's wrong."},{"t":[3.9,5.5],"en":"My brother does not stay out all night."},{"t":[6,7.3],"en":"Maybe we should check the trash chute."},{"t":[9.5,11.7],"en":"Ross couldn't fit down the trash chute?"},{"t":[12.1,13.4],"en":"That's right. He almost could."},{"t":[14.6,16.8],"en":"Which is exactly how I got stuck there."},{"t":[19.1,20.4],"en":"Hey, how are you?"},{"t":[20.4,20.9],"en":"It's good."},{"t":[22.4,23.8],"en":"Where the hell have you been?"},{"t":[25,26.8],"en":"Just, you know, out."},{"t":[27.1,28.3],"en":"Oh, out."},{"t":[28.8,31.1],"en":"Oh, God, I don't know why we didn't think to check there."},{"t":[32.2,33.5],"en":"What were you doing?"},{"t":[33.8,35.3],"en":"I, uh, went to a bar."},{"t":[35.5,39.6],"en":"And then I just, uh, just walked around for a while."},{"t":[40.4,43.6],"en":"You walked around all night in the city by yourself."},{"t":[45.4,46.6],"en":"He hooked up."},{"t":[48.6,50],"en":"He hooked up with someone."},{"t":[50.4,52.6],"en":"Look, I don't have to answer your questions, okay?"},{"t":[52.7,55.1],"en":"I'm a big boy. I can do whatever I want."},{"t":[55.3,56.4],"en":"He hooked up."},{"t":[57.6,60.1],"en":"Tell us about her."},{"t":[61.6,63.3],"en":"Ross, you left your scarf in the..."},{"t":[63.3,72.1],"en":"Hey, you guys."},{"t":[72.1,78.8],"en":"Uh, okay."},{"t":[79.7,80.2],"en":"Oh, okay."},{"t":[80.5,81.9],"en":"I know what you all are thinking."},{"t":[82.4,83.9],"en":"But Chandler is in Yemen."},{"t":[86.3,87.3],"en":"I'm a young woman."},{"t":[87.3,88],"en":"I have needs."},{"t":[88.1,89.1],"en":"I can't wait forever."},{"t":[89.7,90.4],"en":"Yeah, I know."},{"t":[90.4,91.4],"en":"That's what I was thinking."},{"t":[93.7,95.1],"en":"So I'm asking you, please,"},{"t":[95.1,96.2],"en":"just take a moment"},{"t":[96.2,98.1],"en":"before you judge me."},{"t":[98.3,99.4],"en":"Oh, nobody's judging you."},{"t":[100.6,101],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[101.9,103.3],"en":"Okay, you."},{"t":[103.9,105.6],"en":"Mr. Right Place at the right time."},{"t":[107.6,108.4],"en":"Call me."},{"t":[117.6,120.2],"en":"Okay, look, I know what you guys are gonna say."},{"t":[120.4,122.2],"en":"You two would have very hairy children."},{"t":[124.7,126.4],"en":"Okay, I didn't know you would say that."},{"t":[128,129.4],"en":"Ross! Janice!"},{"t":[129.9,131.4],"en":"Alright, hold on, hold on, hold on."},{"t":[131.9,133.8],"en":"This is Ross, okay?"},{"t":[133.9,134.7],"en":"He's our friend."},{"t":[135.3,136.7],"en":"He obviously went crazy."},{"t":[137.3,139],"en":"He obviously lost his mind."},{"t":[139.7,142.4],"en":"I didn't lose my mind, okay?"},{"t":[142.6,144.3],"en":"Janice and I have a lot in common."},{"t":[144.4,146.3],"en":"We've both been divorced."},{"t":[146.8,148.2],"en":"We both have kids."},{"t":[148.3,150.2],"en":"So are you actually gonna see her again?"},{"t":[150.4,152.2],"en":"Phoebe, don't put ideas in his head."},{"t":[152.3,153.8],"en":"I am gonna see her again."},{"t":[153.9,154.6],"en":"Damn it, Phoebe!"}]}
